title: "Nika"
abstract: "Say it once. Keep it as a file. Nika turns the AI work you repeat into a readable workflow that stays yours: checked before it runs (schema, permits, cost floor), run with the model you choose, proven afterwards by a tamper-evident trace. Single Rust binary."
